<h3>Installation</h3>
<p>To start out, of course, you'll need WordPress installed if you don't already have it. It is highly recommended that you upgrade to the latest version.</p>

<p>Then you'll need to take this theme's folder that you extract from the .zip file and upload it to the themes directory of WordPress on your server (wp-content/themes) and activate it in the Wordpress dashboard. All of these directions are available in greater detail in the WordPress documentation (also known as the codex) available <a href="http://codex.wordpress.org" target="new">here</a>.</p>

<p>Once you have the theme installed and are all set to go, there are a couple of things you'll need to do in your WordPress Dashboard (the administration portion of WordPress) to get this theme configured for proper use. To do this please be sure to visit the <a href="creating-first-pages.php">Creating a Home Page, Blog Page, &amp; Other Pages</a> section.</p>

